        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{b}{\\sin B}=\\dfrac{a}{\\sin A}$",
          "worked": "By the sine rule,\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{b}{\\sin B}&=\\frac{a}{\\sin A}\\\\b&=\\frac{a\\sin B}{\\sin A}.\\end{align*}$$",
