        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\operatorname{Area}\\triangle ABC=\\dfrac{a^2\\sin B\\sin C}{2\\sin A}$.\n\nSubstitute $b=\\dfrac{a\\sin B}{\\sin A}$ into the area formula.",
          "worked": "Using part (c), substitute for $b$ in the area formula:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\operatorname{Area}\\triangle ABC&=\\frac12ab\\sin C\\\\\\operatorname{Area}\\triangle ABC&=\\frac12a\\left(\\frac{a\\sin B}{\\sin A}\\right)\\sin C\\\\\\operatorname{Area}\\triangle ABC&=\\frac{a^2\\sin B\\sin C}{2\\sin A}.\\end{align*}$$",
